little sad.","sentences":["‘I am too small,’ sighed the little star.","‘Nobody needs a tiny light like mine.’ And she felt a little sad."],"image":"sha256:ef430b5fa2551adf090c26b29f3eb981b0a4c623227f230c19279aab0d578dfc","alt":"The little star looks down, her glow dimmer, looking sad.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:249e342d87173c0a83e84ed359ae1ac7326cb7688425a890a31b24d3343029b5","durationMs":11555,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4722],[4722,11555]],"words":[[0,201],[201,402],[402,703],[703,1708],[1708,2311],[2311,2612],[2612,3215],[3215,4722],[4722,5325],[5325,5827],[5827,6028],[6028,6430],[6430,6932],[6932,7334],[7334,8841],[8841,9142],[9142,9443],[9443,9845],[9845,10046],[10046,10649],[10649,11555]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"The Moon heard her sigh. ‘Little star,’ said the Moon, ‘keep shining. Every light has a job to do.’","sentences":["The Moon heard her sigh.","‘Little star,’ said the Moon, ‘keep shining.","Every light has a job to do.’"],"image":"sha256:5370e755bc99d2b39471f1dcade9aeaec6b2a7438ae226debe2b5d3a2f3b9407","alt":"A big kind moon speaks to the little star in the night sky.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:fa3bad63a56e7cc01cdc6d01e50aaaf14568e12b2da8142bbc4d5410ae8a7260","durationMs":13907,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3758],[3758,10399],[10399,13907]],"words":[[0,376],[376,877],[877,1503],[1503,1879],[1879,3758],[3758,4510],[4510,5638],[5638,6139],[6139,6515],[6515,7643],[7643,8144],[8144,10399],[10399,11025],[11025,11651],[11651,12027],[12027,12278],[12278,12654],[12654,12905],[12905,13907]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Far below, a traveller was walking home. The path was dark, and the big stars were hiding behind a cloud.","sentences":["Far below, a traveller was walking home.","The path was dark, and the big stars were hiding behind a cloud."],"image":"sha256:4e34369192ace5df47eb8468f676f3253e8e83bd365890702d6a107e8c2bf577","alt":"A woman carrying a bundle walks along a dark path under a cloud-covered sky.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:a99e1f05d77431fd29538fb1d3b311927434ddd65a319570aae40a4ddc3b71f3","durationMs":11795,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5208],[5208,11795]],"words":[[0,319],[319,1382],[1382,1595],[1595,2551],[2551,2870],[2870,3614],[3614,5208],[5208,5527],[5527,5952],[5952,6271],[6271,7227],[7227,7546],[7546,7865],[7865,8184],[8184,8715],[8715,9140],[9140,9778],[9778,10416],[10416,10629],[10629,11795]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"‘Oh dear,’ said the traveller. ‘I cannot see the path.’ Then she saw a tiny light peeping through a gap in the cloud.","sentences":["‘Oh dear,’ said the traveller.","‘I cannot see the path.’ Then she saw a tiny light peeping through a gap in the cloud."],"image":"sha256:9874d894172c8ef12757bc3646a13aec7226c480a658f585c7c0b11ff50ec5de","alt":"The traveller looks up as one small star shines through a gap in the clouds.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:32a924358a418717f5f04c01a70922622b602255483bc4ad92423de9ce3ceeef","durationMs":13787,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4259],[4259,13787]],"words":[[0,224],[224,1233],[1233,1681],[1681,2017],[2017,4259],[4259,4483],[4483,5156],[5156,5492],[5492,5828],[5828,7509],[7509,7957],[7957,8293],[8293,8629],[8629,8853],[8853,9301],[9301,9861],[9861,10646],[10646,11431],[11431,11655],[11655,11991],[11991,12215],[12215,12551],[12551,13787]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Shine, shine, shine, went the little star, as bright as she could. The traveller followed the tiny light, one step, two steps, three steps.","sentences":["Shine, shine, shine, went the little star, as bright as she could.","The traveller followed the tiny light, one step, two steps, three steps."],"image":"sha256:2063ea02e4fbdc843526be4949e1f9b70968e289082afa6952977a89df157a9b","alt":"The traveller follows a faint path of starlight along the ground.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:0d60d552301c42fe612bd5f8082128c320f5e90be23c2c49dfcf7dddd